The camera wearer is beside a freshly plastered wall in a narrow construction area. The person in purple is closest—roughly arm’s reach ahead and facing the wall/work area—while two other workers stand several feet farther away near buckets and materials. Tools and containers are nearby, and the closest worker partially occupies the wearer’s forward path.

The most appropriate action is to hand the nearby person a tool, supporting the ongoing collaborative construction work.

